    "implication_note": "`implies` records skills that possessing this one genuinely evidences. Used only to expand PROFILE evidence, never to expand job-description extraction: a posting asking for Kubernetes is not asking for Docker. Implication is a fact about the technology (you cannot orchestrate containers without containers), not an inference about the person."
  },
